{"study_accession":"PRJNA823543","secondary_study_accession":"SRP367602","title":"Gene expression profile at single cell level of mononuclear cells from the liver sinusoid","description":"This study identified a distinct liver sinusoidal NK-like CD56hiCD161-CD8+ T-cell population that expands in the liver with hepatitis B virus-associated chronic liver disease. CD56hiCD161-CD8+ T cells exert NKG2C-mediated NK-like effector functions even without TCR stimulation. Overall design: We obtained liver sinusoidal mononuclear cells from the liver perfusate of healthy donors and recipients with hepatitis B virus (HBV)-associated chronic liver disease (CLD) during liver transplantation. We performed a CITE-seq analysis of liver sinusoidal CD45+ cells in combination with TCR-seq of liver sinusoidal mononuclear cells. Please note that several samples were pooled into 1 GEM, and hashtags were used to distinguish each sample; lsmc1_1: hashtag1 (HBV 1) lsmc1_2: hashtag4 (HBV 2) lsmc2_1: hashtag1 & hashtag4 (HC1 & 2) lsmc2_2: hashtag2 & hashtag3 (HC3 & 4) lsmc2_3: hashtag1 & hashtag4 (HBV 3 & 4) lsmc2_4: hashtag2 (HBV 5)","pubmed":"35644434","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN27305119","study_accession":"PRJNA823543","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"study","title":"mRNA_lsmc2_4","description":"mRNA_lsmc2_4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6019633","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-08-11","attributes":[["source_name","liver sinusoid"],["tissue","liver sinusoid"],["cell_type","mononuclear cell"],["library type","mRNA"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR18636184","experiment_accession":"SRX14743332","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 550","read_count":207391553,"base_count":24264811701,"first_public":"2022-08-11","experiment_title":"NextSeq 550 sequencing: GSM6019633: mRNA_lsmc2_4 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":true},{"sample_accession":"SAMN27305120","study_accession":"PRJ